      "description": "Cross-appointed Faculty | School of Kinesiology and Health Studies Skip to main content Skip to footer School of Kinesiology and Health Studies Sign In School of Kinesiology and Health Studies Main navigation Home About Us People Down arrow Faculty Staff Cross-appointed Faculty Teaching Adjuncts Teaching Fellows Adjunct 1 Students Down arrow Undergraduate Studies Current Students Awards Course Information Certificate in Disability and Physical Activity (DIPA) Graduate Studies Overview Down arrow Graduate Studies SKHS Graduate Student Handbook Community Down arrow Community Overview Courses with Community Engagement How to Get Involved SKHS Community Outreach Programs Student Initiatives in the Community Employment Down arrow Current Opportunities News & Events Down arrow SKHS News Overview Research Contact Us People Cross-appointed Faculty Cross-appointed Faculty Michael Adams - The Department of Biomedical and Molecular Sciences Brenda Brouwer - The School of Rehabilitation Therapy Patricia Collins - Department of Geography and Planning Sam McKegney Department of English sam.mckegney@queensu.ca View Sam McKegney School of Kinesiology and Health Studies 28 Division Street, Queens University Kingston, Ontario K7L3N6 Canada Tel: 613-533-2666 skhs.admin@queensu.ca Hours Monday to Friday 8:30 am – Noon; 1:00 pm – 4:30 pm (closed between noon – 1pm daily) Web Privacy Queen’s University is situated on the territory of the Haudenosaunee and Anishinaabek . © 2026 Queen’s University"
