    "https://www.queensu.ca/religion/people/faculty/emeritus-and-retired-faculty": {
      "title": "Main navigation",
      "description": "Emeritus and Retired Faculty | School of Religion Skip to main content Skip to footer Sign In School of Religion Main navigation Home Undergraduate Down arrow Undergraduate Overview Degree Programs & Plans Current Course Offerings RELS Courses at a Glance RELS Courses as Electives Departmental Student Council Student Forms Quick Links FAQs Graduate Down arrow Graduate Overview MA Program Admission Requirements Application Process Funding and Awards Current Course Offerings Graduate Supervision Resources for Graduate Students Our Students People Down arrow People Overview Administration Faculty Down arrow Faculty Overview Amarnath Amarasingam Richard S. Ascough Dustin Atlas Danielle LaGrone Jennifer S. Leath Jorge Legoas P. Sharday C. Mosurinjohn Aditi Sen Tracy J. Trothen M. Shobhana Xavier Emeritus and Retired Faculty Postdoctoral Fellows Down arrow Postdoctoral Fellows Overview Teaching Fellows Down arrow Teaching Fellows Overview Research Down arrow Research Overview Faculty Publications Religion, Gender, Sexuality and Youth Down arrow Religion, Gender, Sexuality and Youth Overview Project Aims Research Team Advisory Committee Results Contact Alumni Down arrow Alumni Overview Alumni Profiles News & Events Down arrow News & Events Overview News Events Employment Opportunities Contact People Faculty Emeritus and Retired Faculty Emeritus and Retired Faculty Emeritus Faculty Dr. Herbert W. Basser , Professor Emeritus of Religious Studies and Judaism Dr. Daniel J. Fraikin, Professor Emeritus of Greek and New Testament Dr. Clifford G. Hospital , Professor Emeritus of the Comparative Study of Religion Dr. William C. James , Professor Emeritus of Religion and Literature Dr. William S. Morrow , Professor Emeritus of Hebrew Scriptures Dr. Marguerite Van Die , Professor Emeritus of History of Christianity Dr. Pamela Dickey Young , Professor Emeritus of Religion in Contemporary North America Retired Faculty Dr. Ellen Goldberg , Retired Associate Professor of Religions of South Asia Dr. Forough Jahanbakhsh , Associate Professor (tenured), Islam in the Modern World Queen's School of Religion Theological Hall, Suite 211 Kingston, ON K7L 3N6 Canada Tel: 613 533 2106 Footer menu Campus Security Accessibility Services Accessibility Services Wellness Services Student Wellness Services Web Privacy Queen’s University is situated on the territory of the Haudenosaunee and Anishinaabek . © 2026 Queen’s University"
